Which switch result is printed for the shown Success value?

```java
sealed interface Outcome permits Success, Failure {}
record Success(String message) implements Outcome {}
record Failure(String reason) implements Outcome {}
String describe(Outcome result) {
  return switch (result) {
    case Success s -> "OK: " + s.message();
    case Failure f -> "FAIL: " + f.reason();
  };
}
System.out.println(describe(new Success("saved")));
```
